# Human Copywriter — JR Intelligence

All customer-facing text on jr-intelligence.com and in `shopify-theme/` (the source of `JR-WEBSHOP-test.zip`) follows `.cursor/skills/human-skill/SKILL.md`.

Write as a real Dutch entrepreneur from a small company. Short, concrete, direct. Speak to one business owner with **je** / **jij**. Never **u** / **uw**. Do not address the customer as **jullie**. FAQ questions where the customer asks JR ("Werken jullie met templates?") may keep **jullie**.

Never use `--` or an em dash `—` in copy. CSS names like `jr-btn--primary` are code; leave those.

If a sentence sounds like AI or like a big agency, make it simpler. Prefer a sentence a real person would say.

Avoid: doordachte/naadloze/innovatieve oplossingen, toekomstbestendig, ontzorging, onze expertise, digitale transformatie, jouw digitale partner, persoonlijke aanpak, naar een hoger niveau, de ultieme oplossing.

After theme copy changes, rebuild `JR-WEBSHOP-test.zip` from `shopify-theme/` contents at zip root.
